<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body>


<div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Iterative Learning</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">As previously quoted, in </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinarity</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> the journey that matters most.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This also applies to how we learn within a project. Transdisciplinary learning is </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">iterative learning</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">When tackling complex problems, iterative learning is the only way forward.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Due to the multifaceted and ever-changing nature of such problems, you must regularly revisit the issue and reconsider the action plan throughout the project.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Transformative Learning</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Transformative learning involves changing one’s beliefs about oneself and the world by critically examining received and underlying assumptions (Mezirow, 1981).</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This can be done by exposing oneself to alternative viewpoints and experiences, combined with deep reflection on one’s worldviews and assumptions.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Transdisciplinary education is well-suited to enable transformative learning, especially through its emphasis on exposure to a wide range of knowledge and perspectives, and its focus on reflexivity (</span><span style="margin: 0px">Baumber</span><span style="margin: 0px">, 2022).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Unpredictable Outcomes</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">As mentioned earlier in the design phase, the outcomes of transdisciplinary education are not always measurable in terms of direct progress toward solving the problem.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">You can set output requirements to guide the process toward a solution, but the transformation during the iterative learning process may be an even more important—though less tangible—outcome.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">The open-ended nature of transdisciplinary projects can be confusing and frustrating for students and other stakeholders.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Traditional courses or work projects offer clear, tangible outputs or requirements, while a transdisciplinary project may never truly end.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">You </span><span style="margin: 0px">don’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> have to </span><span style="margin: 0px">reinvent the wheel</span><span style="margin: 0px"> during the process.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Multiple tools and techniques have proven useful in transdisciplinary education.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">A list of useful working methods can be found on the </span><a href="https://trailtool.org/?l=1&amp;i=31&amp;s=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">“How to Learn”</span></span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> page of the design path.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">
</font></span></p><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">References</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Baumber</span><span style="margin: 0px">, A. (2022). Transforming sustainability education through transdisciplinary practice. </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Environment, </span><span style="margin: 0px">development</span><span style="margin: 0px"> and sustainability, 24</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">(6), 7622-7639</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Mezirow</span><span style="margin: 0px">, J. (1981). A </span><span style="margin: 0px">critical</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">theory</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of adult </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">education</span><span style="margin: 0px">. </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Adult </span><span style="margin: 0px">educatio</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">n</span><span style="margin: 0px">, 32(1), 3-24</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><br></p></div><p style="color: windowtext; margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; color: windowtext"></span></p></div></body>
</html>